UPDATE companies SET description='D&R Products operates from a 43,000-square-foot facility in Hudson, Massachusetts. The company traces its roots to 1938, marking over 80 years of continuous American manufacturing, with the last 38 years dedicated specifically to contract manufacturing for medical devices.

As a contract manufacturer, D&R provides turnkey, in-house production from bar stock to finished device. Capabilities span CNC Swiss and American-style turning, wire EDM, precision grinding on four Rollamatic grinders with robotic feeding and lights-out operation, secondary finishing (deburring, polishing, tumbling, electropolishing, passivation, laser marking), clean room assembly and packaging in ISO Class 7 and Class 8 environments, and welding (laser, palm arc, resistance). The shop works with exotic alloys such as nitinol, titanium, PEEK, and Radel, and has developed proprietary machining methods for nitinol. Annual output ranges from small lots to millions of pieces, with tens of thousands of projects completed and millions of products shipped.

The customer base consists of medical device OEMs, including six of the seven largest companies in the sector, and the firm serves as a sole-source supplier for more than 75 percent of its product lines. Typical components include nitinol-based implants, minimally invasive surgical instruments, arthroscopic shaver blades and burrs, RF electrodes, soft tissue refixation implants, and specialty needles, cannulas, and trocars.

D&R emphasizes keeping critical processes under one roof to shorten throughput, maintain traceability to raw bar stock, and control quality through its ISO 13485:2016 system. Customers work directly with the executive team and engineers without middle management, enabling custom process development, fixture and tooling design, reverse engineering, and Cpk analysis tailored to each project.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 13485:2016']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["CNC Swiss turning", "CNC American-style turning", "Wire EDM", "Precision grinding", "Lights-out manufacturing", "Robotic feeding", "Deburring (10X)", "Buffing and polishing", "Tumbling (3 types)", "Electropolishing", "Passivation", "Laser marking", "Clean room assembly and packaging (ISO Class 7)", "Clean room assembly (ISO Class 8)", "Controlled environment assembly (Class 8 standards)", "Laser welding", "Palm arc welding", "Resistance welding", "Fixture and tooling design & fabrication", "Reverse engineering", "Process capability studies (Cpk analysis)", "Exotic material machining (nitinol, titanium, PEEK, Radel)"], "industries": ["Medical devices", "Minimally invasive surgical devices", "Arthroscopic instruments", "RF electrodes", "Orthopedic implants", "Specialty needles, cannulas, trocars", "Nitinol medical devices"], "materials": ["Nitinol", "Titanium", "PEEK", "Radel", "Stainless steel"], "equipment": ["Rollamatic grinders (4)", "CNC Swiss-type lathes", "CNC American-style lathes", "Wire EDM machines", "Robotic feeding systems", "Laser welding equipment", "Palm arc welding equipment", "Resistance welding equipment", "Laser marking systems"], "volume": "Small lots to millions of pieces", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "\u00b10.0002 in", "built_on": ["All key manufacturing processes kept in-house under one roof for traceability and reduced lead time", "Direct engineering access to executive team with no middle management layers", "Proprietary machining techniques developed for difficult materials such as nitinol", "ISO 13485:2016 certified quality system with full material traceability", "Clean room assembly and packaging offered in three configurations (ISO Class 7, Class 8, controlled environment)"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1938 -> /", "Hudson, Massachusetts headquarters -> db", "43,000 sq ft facility -> /", "ISO 13485:2016 certified -> /", "80 years continuous American manufacturing, 38 years medical device contract manufacturing -> /", "6 of 7 top medical device companies as customers -> /", "Sole source supplier on over 75% of products -> /", "Volume: small lots to millions of pieces -> /", "Tens of thousands projects completed, millions products shipped -> /", "CNC machining: Swiss turning, American-style turning, Wire EDM -> /", "4 Rollamatic grinders with robotic feeding, lights-out manufacturing -> /", "Secondary operations: 10X deburring, buffing, polishing, 3 tumbling types, electropolish, passivation, laser marking -> /", "Clean room services: ISO Class 7, ISO Class 8, controlled environment Class 8 -> /", "Welding: laser, palm arc, resistance -> /", "Exotic materials: nitinol, titanium, PEEK, Radel, stainless steel -> /", "Proprietary methods for nitinol machining -> /", "Direct access to executive team and engineers -> /", "Fixture and tooling design, reverse engineering, Cpk analysis -> /", "Products: nitinol medical devices, minimally invasive surgical devices, arthroscopic shaver blades/burrs, RF electrodes, soft tissue refixation implants, specialty needles, cannulas, trocars -> /", "Tolerances: \u00b10.0002 in -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "D&R Products is an expert contract manufacturer of medical devices offering exceptional in-house manufacturing from bar stock to finished device.", "founded_year": "1938", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now(