UPDATE companies SET description='DBS Stainless Steel Fabricators was established in 1985 in Hamilton, Ohio, serving the Cincinnati Tri-State Area with custom stainless steel fabrication. The company began as a metal fabrication shop focused on stainless steel products.

The shop specializes in custom stainless steel fabrication across three main categories: restaurant equipment, industrial parts, and residential countertops. Project records from 2016 through 2025 show work ranging from commercial bar installations to residential countertops and specialty items like copper and brass counter tops.

DBS serves the restaurant industry, industrial clients, and residential customers. Notable projects include stainless steel laundry and trash receptacles for the Cincinnati Bengals, custom countertops for the Indian Hill Residence, and custom steps for an Airstream trailer. The company also produces bar and restaurant fixtures such as pass-through counters, condiment stands, and steam counters.

