UPDATE companies SET description='DairyChem is headquartered in Fishers, Indiana, and has been manufacturing natural dairy flavors since 1933. The family-owned company traces its origins to Dr. Leon Chumlea, who developed a signature dairy flavor by guiding milk fermentation and distilling the most impactful flavor notes. DairyChem later acquired Chumlea''s laboratory and expanded its capabilities and product portfolio.

Today, DairyChem produces dairy concentrates, natural flavors, and clean-label solutions in a modern manufacturing plant. Its core processes include fermentation, steam distillation, and natural enzyme modification of milk, butter, and cheese. The company also offers blended and compounded flavor systems in liquid, paste, or spray-dried powder forms. Two divisions extend its reach: Ingretec, a sister company specializing in cheese flavorings and fillings that are two to six times stronger than conventional cheese, and FLVRtec, a subsidiary creating natural, allergen-free liquid flavors for savory, sweet, and emerging categories.

DairyChem serves food and beverage manufacturers across applications such as sauces, fillings, soups, spreads, dips, dressings, processed cheese, and dairy alternatives.

As a family-owned, independent business, DairyChem emphasizes long-term partnership, short lead times, custom packaging, and flexible ordering. Its R&D team combines deep dairy expertise with modern food science to deliver stable, versatile flavors that perform in real-world processing conditions.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fermentation", "Steam distillation", "Natural enzyme modification", "Blended and compounded flavor systems", "Custom product development", "Floor stock inventory", "Short lead times", "Custom packaging", "Flexible ordering process", "Cheese concentrate production (2-6x strength)", "Natural compound liquid flavor creation", "Spray drying", "Liquid, paste, and powder flavor forms", "Clean label solutions", "Dairy concentrate manufacturing", "Natural flavor manufacturing"], "industries": ["Food manufacturing", "Beverage manufacturing", "Flavor and fragrance industry", "Dairy processing", "Sauce and dressing manufacturing", "Snack food manufacturing", "Dairy alternative manufacturing", "Processed cheese manufacturing"], "materials": ["Fresh dairy ingredients", "Milk", "Butter", "Cheese", "Cream", "Natural enzymes"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["85+ years of experience in natural dairy flavoring", "Family-owned and independent", "Proprietary steam distillation and natural enzyme modification processes", "Short lead times and flexible ordering", "Custom product development with R&D support"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1933 -> /about", "Family-owned -> /about", "Headquartered in Fishers, Indiana -> / (contact info)", "Founder Dr. Leon Chumlea -> /about", "Fermentation and steam distillation processes -> /about", "Natural enzyme modification of milk, butter, cheese -> /about", "Blended and compounded flavor systems in liquid, paste, spray-dried powder -> /about", "Ingretec sister company specializing in cheese flavorings and fillings -> / and /about", "FLVRtec subsidiary producing natural compound liquid flavors -> / and /about", "Custom product development, floor stock, short lead times, custom packaging, flexible ordering -> /", "Applications: sauces, fillings, soups, spreads, dips, dressings, processed cheese, dairy alternatives -> /about", "85+ years of experience -> /", "R&D team combines deep dairy expertise with modern food science -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "DairyChem uses fresh dairy ingredients and unique combinations of food processing technologies to manufacture its natural dairy flavors", "founded_year": "1933", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/dairychem/"], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='dairychem' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Dakota Metal Fabrication was established in 2007 in Manvel, North Dakota. A branch office serves customers from Fargo.

The company provides metal fabrication, welding, and HVAC services from its Manvel facility. Capabilities include sheet metal fabrication, stainless steel welding, custom one-of-a-kind fabrication, and production runs of metal items. The shop works with stainless steel, aluminum, and copper, and also fabricates food processing equipment.

Customers span commercial HVAC, industrial ventilation, and the broader sheet metal, heating, and air-conditioning sectors. The firm serves both custom and production needs for food processing equipment and other industrial metalwork.

