UPDATE companies SET description='Dane Manufacturing operates from Waunakee, Wisconsin, where it was established in 1917 by a group of local investors to produce a below‑the‑frost‑line water pump. The company’s early success came with the Can’t Clog hog feeder, a staple in agriculture, before it transitioned into contract manufacturing. In 2001, engineer and CEO Troy Berg acquired the business, steering it toward innovation while retaining a focus on employee development and customer service.

Technical support covers process planning and material selection. Quality control relies on an InspecVision Planar P220.35 high‑speed 2D measurement system alongside staff inspections. Production takes place in a 510,000‑square‑foot smart factory that incorporates automated equipment and streamlined operations.

Dane primarily serves OEM manufacturers across various sectors, drawing on a history that includes agricultural equipment. The company positions itself as a partner that handles projects from initial design through final delivery, offering logistics support such as packaging and shipping.

The company’s stated mission is to enrich employees, customers, and the community through entrepreneurial spirit and innovative metal solutions. Core values — Invest, Innovate, Integrity, Excellence — guide its operations. Dane highlights its ISO 9001:2015 certification, six INC 5000 awards (2007, 2008, 2009, 2013, 2019, 2020), and a culture of continuous capability expansion as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Metal fabrication", "Contract manufacturing", "Laser cutting", "Forming", "Welding", "Assembly & integration", "Packaging & shipping", "Order fulfillment", "Finishing", "Quality control", "Technical support", "Process planning", "Material selection", "Fixturing"], "industries": ["OEM manufacturers", "Agriculture"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["InspecVision Planar P220.35"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 100 years of contract manufacturing and metal fabrication experience", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management system", "510,000 sq ft smart factory with automated manufacturing", "InspecVision Planar P220.35 high\u2011speed 2D measurement for in\u2011process inspection", "Six\u2011time INC 5000 award winner (2007, 2008, 2009, 2013, 2019, 2020)"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1917 by local investors -> /about", "Purchased by Troy Berg in 2001 -> /about", "510,000 sq ft facility in 2024 -> /about", "ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /quality", "InspecVision Planar P220.35 measurement system -> /quality", "Six-time INC 5000 award winner -> /about", "Headquarters in Waunakee, Wisconsin -> db", "LinkedIn URL -> db", "Capabilities: metal fabrication, contract manufacturing, assembly, packaging, fulfillment, technical support, finishing, quality control -> /, /about, /quality", "Industries: OEM manufacturers, agriculture -> /about", "Mission and core values -> /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Ove