UPDATE companies SET description='Discovery Semiconductors operates from Ewing Township, New Jersey. The company began operations in 1993 and has maintained a clean room facility since 1998 for high-reliability manufacturing. No ownership tags or founders are disclosed in the source material.

The company manufactures ultrafast, high-optical-power-handling InGaAs photodetectors, RF-over-fiber optical receivers, balanced optical receivers, extended-wavelength photodetectors, and custom photonic products. Its instrumentation line includes the Lab Buddy and Optical Coherent Receiver System. Production takes place in a dedicated clean room, though facility size and headcount are not specified.

Products serve telecommunications, data communications, avionics, aerospace, and space missions (LEO, GEO, lunar, and Mars). Applications include analog RF links, ultrafast digital communications, sensing, optical communications, RF photonics, LIDAR, and laser interferometry. A noted example is the space-qualified InGaAs quad photodiode plus transimpedance amplifier receiver.

Discovery emphasizes high-reliability manufacturing in its clean room and has been recognized as a 2020 and 2021 Military & Aerospace Electronics Innovators Award honoree. The company positions itself as a leader in high-optical-power-handling and ultrafast InGaAs devices.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["InGaAs photodetector fabrication", "RF over fiber optical receiver assembly", "Balanced optical receiver production", "Extended wavelength photodetector manufacturing", "Custom photonic product development", "Lab Buddy instrumentation design", "Optical Coherent Receiver System integration", "Clean room high-reliability manufacturing", "Space qualification testing", "Radiation hardness testing"], "industries": ["Telecommunications", "Data communications", "Avionics", "Aerospace", "Space (LEO, GEO, lunar, Mars)", "Defense", "RF photonics", "LIDAR", "Laser interferometry", "Optical communications", "Sensing"], "materials": ["InGaAs"], "equipment": ["Lab Buddy instrumentation", "Optical Coherent Receiver System"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Clean room manufacturing facility operated since 1998", "20+ photodiode and photoreceiver variants for SWIR space missions", "RF bandwidth coverage from a few MHz to several GHz", "Honoree, Military & Aerospace Electronics Innovators Award (2020, 2021)", "Lab Buddy and Optical Coherent Receiver System instrumentation"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1993, began operations -> /", "Clean room facility since 1998 -> /", "Location Ewing Township, New Jersey -> db", "Product lines: InGaAs photodetectors, RF over fiber receivers, balanced receivers, extended wavelength photodetectors, custom products -> /", "Instrumentation: Lab Buddy, Optical Coherent Receiver System -> /", "Industries: telecom, datacom, avionics, aerospace, space missions (LEO, GEO, Moon, Mars) -> /", "Applications: analog RF links, ultrafast digital communications, sensing, optical communications, RF photonics,