UPDATE companies SET description='Dogwood Solar is based in Columbia, Missouri, and has been serving the state since 2010. The company is owned and operated by Dan Shifley, who holds NABCEP certification and a Master Electrician license in Columbia. Shifley founded the business with a mission to promote solar energy alternatives and provide sustainable options to homeowners and business owners.

The firm specializes in the design and installation of solar photovoltaic systems and battery backup storage for residential and commercial properties. Dogwood Solar provides a 10-year workmanship warranty in addition to manufacturer warranties on equipment.

Customers range from homeowners in Boone County and surrounding areas to businesses and non-profit organizations across Missouri. The company has completed projects for repeat clients and participates in community events such as the Columbia Earth Day Festival and the Green Expo.

