UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 2011 by Freddie Provenzano in Colorado Springs, Colorado, Eden Oaks began as a small operation run out of a storage unit. The company has since expanded to a 20,000-square-foot woodworking shop employing 25 full-time craftsmen and professionals.

