UPDATE companies SET description='Elec-Tron operates from Wichita, Kansas. Founded in April 1946 as Zimco Metal Products, a contract manufacturer of metal stampings and assemblies, the company shifted its focus in 1954 to electrical switches, terminal blocks, and terminal boards. In May 2022 it was acquired by North Park Group, a Chicago-based private family investment group that acquires family-owned U.S. manufacturers.

The company produces power termination and electrical connectors, including terminal blocks, terminal boards, fuse panels, mechanical aluminum lug connectors, and a range of terminals (quick-connect, screw, bifurcated soldering, and quick-connect tabs). Manufacturing is performed in-house, encompassing molding, stamping, assembly, and terminal identification printing. Annual output exceeds 10 million units shipped to over 300 customers. All components carry UL and CSA recognition.

Elec-Tron serves aerospace, appliance, automotive, electrical distribution, HVAC, commercial food and kitchen equipment, vending machines, industrial equipment, military, electric vehicle, and commercial equipment markets. Specific applications include furnaces, air conditioners, ovens, ranges, refrigerators, recreational vehicles, farm equipment, marine systems, material handling equipment, automatic door and gate openers, and motor controls.', certifications=ARRAY['UL recognized','CSA recognized']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom molded terminal blocks", "Steel stamping", "Terminal identification printing", "Fuse panel assembly", "Aluminum lug connector fabrication", "Quick connect terminal manufacturing", "Screw terminal manufacturing", "Bifurcated soldering terminal manufacturing", "Quick connect tab manufacturing (single, double, triple)"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Appliance", "Automotive", "Electrical Distribution", "HVAC", "Commercial food and kitchen equipment", "Vending machines", "Industrial equipment", "Military", "Electric vehicles", "Commercial equipment", "Recreational vehicles", "Farm equipment", "Marine", "Material handling equipment", "Automatic door and gate openers", "Motor control"], "materials": ["Aluminum", "Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Over 10,000,000 products annually", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house component and assembly manufacturing", "Over 10 million products delivered annually", "Serves more than 300 unique customers", "All components UL and CSA recognized", "Engineering support for custom connections in space-constrained applications"], "facts_used": ["Founded as Zimco Metal Products in April 1946 -> /", "Shifted to electrical switches, terminal blocks, and terminal boards in 1954 -> /", "Acquired by North Park Group in May 2022 -> /about-us", "Produces terminal blocks, terminal boards, fuse panels, connectors, terminals -> /", "In-house component and assembly manufacturing -> /", "Over