UPDATE companies SET description='The company focuses on fine enamelled wire, selfbonding wire, Litz wire, and fully insulated wire.

The company produces enamelled wire in diameters from 0.008 mm (8 microns) up to 0.50 mm, with custom diameters available to customer specifications. Its processes include dual enamel applicators for insulation and bondcoat, extrusion coatings with low melting points, silver coating, and a multiple-coating process for fully insulated wire that guarantees defect-free insulation. Litz wire is manufactured with taping, extrusion, and serving, while trailing cables and microcables are built for maximum flexibility and low friction.

Elektrisola serves the renewable energy, automotive, medical, and IT industries. In automotive, its Litz wire is used in EV components, inductive high-frequency components for charging stations, coil components for electric motors, and wireless charger components compliant with the Qi standard. For high-voltage applications, the VDE-certified EFOLIT product family meets stringent safety demands. Medical and IT systems also rely on the company''s fine wire and cable constructions.', certifications=ARRAY['RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Enamelled wire production", "Selfbonding wire production", "Litz wire manufacturing (taping, extrusion, serving)", "Silver coating", "Insulation with polyurethane based enamels", "Extrusion coatings with low melting points", "Trailing cable manufacturing", "Microcable with extruded coating", "Fully insulated wire (FIW) multiple coating process", "Fine wire drawing (0.008 mm to 0.50 mm)", "Custom diameter production", "VDE-certified high voltage wire (EFOLIT)", "Inductive high frequency component manufacturing", "Coil component manufacturing", "Wireless charger component manufacturing (Qi standard)"], "industries": ["Renewable Energy", "Automotive", "Medical", "IT"], "materials": ["Copper", "Silver", "Polyurethane enamels", "Extrusion coatings", "Silk", "Nylon"], "equipment": ["Enamel applicators (insulation and bondcoat)", "Extrusion lines", "Taping machines", "Serving machines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Fine enamelled wire from 0.008 mm to 0.50 mm with custom diameters", "Global footprint: 10 plants in 7 countries, 20 sales offices in 11 countries", "Multiple-coating FIW process guaranteeing insulation without defects", "VDE-certified EFOLIT family for high-voltage safety", "Litz wire with taping, extrusion, and serving for high-frequency applications"], "facts_used": ["HQ: Boscawen, New Hampshire -> db", "Global footprint: 10 plants in 7 countries on 3 continents, 20 sales offices in