UPDATE companies SET description='Excalibur Metal Design operates from Nampa, Idaho, where it has been designing and fabricating architectural metal products since 2001. The company was founded to provide custom metal fabrication services for residential and commercial projects across the state, and it now counts thousands of satisfied clients.

