UPDATE companies SET description='FRAE, Inc. has served Lexington, Nebraska, and the surrounding Central Nebraska region since its founding in 1978. The second-generation family-owned business began as a local HVAC and electrical service provider and has remained under family leadership through two generations.

The company provides installation, maintenance, and repair services for residential and light commercial heating, cooling, and electrical systems. As an authorized dealer for Champion and Daikin, FRAE supplies and services HVAC equipment from those brands, and also handles generator installation and maintenance. The team completed more than 2,758 projects, with technicians described as certified and experienced.

FRAE’s customers are homeowners and businesses in Kearney, Lexington, and nearby communities. The company focuses on residential and light commercial markets, offering a single point of contact for HVAC, electrical, and generator needs.

FRAE emphasizes clear communication, dependable local support, and energy-efficient solutions. The company’s stated approach is to deliver peace of mind rather than simply selling equipment, with a process that moves from consultation through agreement, execution, and a final quality check. Financing is available through a third-party provider for larger projects.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["HVAC installation, maintenance, and repair (residential and light commercial)", "Electrical installation, repair, and maintenance", "Generator installation and service", "Lighting and wiring installation", "Energy efficiency consulting and solutions", "Authorized Champion HVAC system dealer", "Authorized Daikin HVAC system dealer", "Project consultation and design", "Quality inspection and testing"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Champion HVAC systems", "Daikin HVAC systems", "Generators"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Authorized dealer for Champion and Daikin HVAC systems", "Certified, experienced technicians for HVAC, electrical, and generator work", "Single-source provider for HVAC, electrical, and generator services", "Local, family-owned operation serving Central Nebraska since 1978", "Financing available through Optimus for larger projects"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1978 -> db", "Second-generation family-owned -> db", "Headquartered in Lexington, Nebraska -> db", "Authorized dealer for Champion and Daikin -> page ''/''", "Provides HVAC, electrical, generator, and maintenance services for residential and light commercial customers -> page ''/''", "Serves Kearney, Lexington, and surrounding Central Nebraska communities -> page ''/''", "Completed 2,758+ projects -> page ''/''", "Offers financing through Optimus -> page ''/''", "Emphasizes energy efficiency, clear communication, and local support -> page ''/''", "Certified, experienced technicians -> page ''/''"], "company_type": "Instal