UPDATE companies SET description='FUJIFILM Electronic Materials U.S.A., Inc. operates from its headquarters in North Kingstown, Rhode Island, as a wholly owned subsidiary of FUJIFILM Holding America Corporation. The business is part of Fujifilm''s global electronic materials division, which maintains offices in the United States, Japan, and Belgium along with multiple manufacturing and research facilities worldwide.

